          "description": "400% damage to 1 enemy, plus 200% for each charge stored by the user (max of 1000% total damage while 3 charges are stored by the user). This attack does not wake up sleeping enemies, and ignores skin passive skills and the Counter Stance status effect.\n\nThen the target hit will become Weakened, and be granted a Rage Ward. This will overwrite any existing Weak or Enrage effects on that unit.\n\nRage Wards will prevent a unit from becoming Enraged once, then be removed. Rage Wards cannot stack. Weakened units have their Attack reduced to 0.75x until the end of their next turn. The effect of Weakening may be diminished if the affected unit's Attack is increased by other effects and it can be overwritten by Enrage effects.",
